// #region 🔖Header
// [👤compose🖱️desktop💻renderer](repo://p/u/compose/b/u/desktop/f/renderer.tsx)

// 2025 Ueli Saluz <ueli@semio-tech.com>

// This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
